<div
  class="w-full box-border scrollbar-none snap-center bg-bg-card shrink-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden"
>
  <div
    class="w-full flex flex-col items-center shadow-sm text-center px-4 py-5 md:py-7 lg:py-8 border-b border-border-light"
  >
    <h2
      class="text-text-title font-extrabold text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl leading-tight antialiased"
    >
      Por qué creamos Munitrip
    </h2>
    <h3
      class="text-text-secondary font-extrabold text-base md:text-lg -mb-1.5 antialiased"
    >
      Nuestro propósito
    </h3>
  </div>

  <div
    class="w-full h-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mt-8 md:mt-10 lg:mt-12 px-6 text-center"
  >
    <p
      class="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg font-medium text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-balance italic"
    >
      "Creemos en la magia inexplorada de nuestros municipios. <span
        class="font-bold"
