    </p>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg font-bold text-text-title antialiased">
        Deiby Merchán
      </span>
      <span
        class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-text-secondary opacity-90"
      >
        Fundador de Munitrip
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
